{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BPrfNQRmUn7djd7foWq9bJ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"schema_version\": \"1.0.0\",\n3\t  \"app\": \"pinewood-derby-sim\",\n4\t  \"id\": \"0003-web-front-end\",\n5\t  \"title\": \"Web front-end (interactive car builder & race UI)\",\n6\t  \"status\": \"building\",\n7\t  \"description\": \"The interactive front-end that lets a kid (12-17) actually drive the simulator: configure a car (weight, placement, wheels, axle, body, alignment), race it, watch the run animate on the track, read a plain-language 'where did your speed go?' breakdown + 'why', and save/load designs in a local garage. Folds in the former 0002 presentation layer (0003 owns both the pure RaceResult->kid-language translation AND the UI). Platform: static web app running the pure Python engine in-browser via Pyodide (WASM), hosted free on GitHub Pages; no network at runtime, all assets same-origin, no PII. Build deferred until the 0001 engine contract (CarDesign/RaceResult) stabilizes. PRD/TRD authored and APPROVED 2026-06-02; all 3 open questions resolved (audience 12-17 skewed young; stack = vanilla TS+Vite+canvas+vendored Pyodide; two non-finish modes distinguished per AC-R4).\",\n8\t  \"created_at\": \"2026-06-02T00:00:00Z\",\n9\t  \"updated_at\": \"2026-06-03T10:59:50.154182+00:00\",\n10\t  \"planning\": {\n11\t    \"session_id\": \"3fb6a1ed-cfb8-40c7-ab67-33ea52bb80b9\"\n12\t  },\n13\t  \"prd_ref\": \"agentic-sdlc/apps/pinewood-derby-sim/features/0003-web-front-end/PRD.html\",\n14\t  \"trd_ref\": \"agentic-sdlc/apps/pinewood-derby-sim/features/0003-web-front-end/TRD.html\",\n15\t  \"backlog_ref\": null,\n16\t  \"summary_ref\": null,\n17\t  \"run_record_refs\": [],\n18\t  \"changeset_refs\": [],"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55f4d0f9-3f78-404c-9d9b-b1c51c035e71","uuid":"1ff8928f-597a-408e-b845-8c62ee887626","timestamp":"2026-06-03T12:50:27.318Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":